{
	...
	public $cache = array();
	...
	function get($title, $eslashes=1, $htmlcomments=1)
	{
		global $db, $theme, $mybb;
		...
		$template = $this->cache[$title];
		...
		return $template;
	}
```

If we can control the `$cache`, we will be albe to inject php code via eval() function.

inc/init.php
```
